        <p>
            <strong>What is Agentic AI?</strong>
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Autonomous Action:</strong>
            Unlike standard chatbots that just answer questions when prompted,
            agents can break a large goal into smaller steps and execute them.
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Tool Use:</strong>
            These systems can browse the web, write and run computer code,
            open apps, and interact with external software to solve problems.
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Self-Correction:</strong>
            Agents check their own work, fix errors in their code or logic,
            and try a different approach if the first attempt fails.
        </p>

